# Minimal KPSet TBox fixture — forces OptimizedKPSetClassSubsumptionClassifierThread.
# owl:unionOf creates non-deterministic tableau choices, triggering KPSet class classification.
# ~20 classes, produces inferred rdfs:subClassOf edges, fast (<1s per run).
<http://example.org/kpset> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .

# Named classes
<http://example.org/kpset#Thing> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/kpset#A> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/kpset#B> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/kpset#C> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/kpset#D> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/kpset#E> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/kpset#F> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/kpset#G> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/kpset#H> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/kpset#I> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/kpset#J> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/kpset#K> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/kpset#L> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/kpset#M> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .

# Property
<http://example.org/kpset#p> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://example.org/kpset#q> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .

# Simple hierarchy
<http://example.org/kpset#A> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/kpset#Thing> .
<http://example.org/kpset#B> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/kpset#Thing> .
<http://example.org/kpset#C> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/kpset#A> .
<http://example.org/kpset#D> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/kpset#A> .
<http://example.org/kpset#E> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/kpset#B> .
<http://example.org/kpset#F> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/kpset#B> .

# owl:unionOf — forces non-deterministic tableau (triggers KPSet class classifier)
_:u1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
_:u1 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:list1 .
_:list1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://example.org/kpset#C> .
_:list1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:list1b .
_:list1b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://example.org/kpset#E> .
_:list1b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<http://example.org/kpset#G> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> _:u1 .

_:u2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
_:u2 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:list2 .
_:list2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://example.org/kpset#D> .
_:list2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:list2b .
_:list2b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://example.org/kpset#F> .
_:list2b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<http://example.org/kpset#H> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> _:u2 .

# Restrictions to deepen tableau expansion
_:r1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
_:r1 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <http://example.org/kpset#p> .
_:r1 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://example.org/kpset#G> .
<http://example.org/kpset#I> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:r1 .

_:r2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
_:r2 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <http://example.org/kpset#p> .
_:r2 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://example.org/kpset#H> .
<http://example.org/kpset#J> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:r2 .

_:r3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
_:r3 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <http://example.org/kpset#q> .
_:r3 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://example.org/kpset#I> .
<http://example.org/kpset#K> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:r3 .

_:r4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
_:r4 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <http://example.org/kpset#q> .
_:r4 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://example.org/kpset#J> .
<http://example.org/kpset#L> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:r4 .

# Additional union to create subsumption between I and K via union of unions
_:u3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
_:u3 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:list3 .
_:list3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://example.org/kpset#K> .
_:list3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:list3b .
_:list3b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://example.org/kpset#L> .
_:list3b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<http://example.org/kpset#M> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> _:u3 .
